  "_comment": "Shipped app taxonomy for Laya Workspace. 'bridge' maps freedesktop Categories= tokens to laya categories (checked in order, first match wins). 'apps' pre-populates the standard Omarchy app set; lib/auto-bucket.py extends 'apps' via the bridge for newly installed apps, and the learned overrides file (~/.local/state/laya-workspace/app-buckets.json) merges on top. Ship the taxonomy empty of machine-specific entries: everything not listed lands in 'utilities' until learned or bridged.",
